---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'August 30, 2026';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy — Glade & Grotto" description="Privacy policy for Idle Grove and other Glade & Grotto apps.">
  <!-- Nav -->
  <header class="w-full px-6 py-6 flex items-center justify-between max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <a href="/" class="font-cinzel text-lg tracking-wide text-brown-dark">Glade <span class="text-terracotta">&</span> Grotto</a>
    <nav class="flex gap-6 text-sm font-inter text-brown-mid">
      <a href="/#about" class="hover:text-terracotta transition-colors">About</a>
      <a href="/#work" class="hover:text-terracotta transition-colors">Our Work</a>
      <a href="/#contact" class="hover:text-terracotta transition-colors">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-8 pb-28">
    <p class="font-inter text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-terracotta mb-4">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="font-cinzel text-3xl md:text-4xl text-brown-dark leading-tight mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="font-inter text-sm text-brown-mid mb-10">Last updated {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="bg-surface rounded-2xl border border-border p-8 md:p-12 shadow-sm font-crimson text-brown-dark leading-relaxed space-y-8">
      <p>
        This policy covers Idle Grove and other apps and games published by Glade &amp; Grotto ("we," "us"). It explains
        what information we collect, why, and how you can control it. We keep this plain-language on purpose — if
        anything here is unclear, email us at
        <a href="mailto:hello@gladeandgrotto.com" class="text-terracotta hover:underline">hello@gladeandgrotto.com</a>
        and we'll clarify.
      </p>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-cinzel text-xl text-brown-dark mb-3">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">When you create an account and play, we collect:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Account information</strong> — your email address, and if you sign in with Google, your Google account's basic profile info (name, email, profile photo).</li>
          <li><strong>Gameplay data</strong> — your character, inventory, progress, and any content you create in-game (e.g. a grove name, chat/trade activity with other players).</li>
          <li><strong>Device and usage data</strong> — basic technical information like device type and app version, used for debugging and stability, not for tracking or advertising.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We do not collect precise location, contacts, photos, or any device data beyond what's needed to run the game
          and keep your save synced across devices.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-cinzel text-xl text-brown-dark mb-3">How We Use It</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>To create and secure your account, and sync your save across devices.</li>
          <li>To operate multiplayer features (groves, trading, parties) — this means other players in your grove or party can see your in-game username and activity.</li>
          <li>To respond to support requests and bug reports.</li>
          <li>To fix bugs and improve the game.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We do not sell your personal information, and we do not use it for third-party advertising. The app currently
          contains no ads.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-cinzel text-xl text-brown-dark mb-3">Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">We rely on a small number of trusted services to run the game:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Supabase</strong> — our backend provider, hosting your account and gameplay data.</li>
          <li><strong>Google Sign-In</strong> — if you choose to sign in with Google, subject to Google's own privacy policy.</li>
          <li><strong>Stripe</strong> — if and when in-app purchases are enabled, payment processing will be handled entirely by Stripe; we do not see or store your card details.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">Each of these providers processes data only as needed to provide their service to us.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-cinzel text-xl text-brown-dark mb-3">Data Retention &amp; Deletion</h2>
        <p>
          We keep your account and gameplay data for as long as your account is active. You can request deletion of
          your account and all associated data at any time by emailing
          <a href="mailto:hello@gladeandgrotto.com" class="text-terracotta hover:underline">hello@gladeandgrotto.com</a>
          — we'll process the request promptly and confirm once it's done.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-cinzel text-xl text-brown-dark mb-3">Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Idle Grove is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from
          children under 13. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, contact us and we will
          delete it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-cinzel text-xl text-brown-dark mb-3">Security</h2>
        <p>
          We take reasonable measures to protect your information, including encrypting data in transit. No method of
          transmission or storage is 100% secure, but we work to keep your data safe and will notify affected users in
          the event of a significant breach.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-cinzel text-xl text-brown-dark mb-3">Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          If this policy changes in a meaningful way, we'll update the date at the top of this page and, where
          appropriate, notify you in-app.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-cinzel text-xl text-brown-dark mb-3">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions, requests, or concerns about your data:
          <a href="mailto:hello@gladeandgrotto.com" class="text-terracotta hover:underline">hello@gladeandgrotto.com</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="border-t border-border py-8 px-6 text-center">
    <p class="font-inter text-xs text-brown-mid">
      &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Glade &amp; Grotto. All rights reserved.
    </p>
  </footer>
</Base>
